	(text "PCMCIA Type I — FM Towns Marty IC card slot\nCD1# (pin 36) and CD2# (pin 67) tied to GND so Marty enumerates the card.\nVS1# (43), VS2# (57), Vpp1 (18), Vpp2 (52) left as no-connect (5V card signalling)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "Level shifters U_LS1, U_LS2, U_LS3 — 74LVC16245A @ VCC=+3V3, A-side 5V-tolerant.\n  U_LS1: data bus D[15:0] bidir, DIR=MA_OE_N (high=Marty drives, low=FPGA drives).\n  U_LS2: address A[15:0] Marty->FPGA, DIR=+3V3 (always A->B).\n  U_LS3: address A[25:16] + control (CE1#, CE2#, OE#, WE#, REG#, RESET) Marty->FPGA.\nAll ~OE tied to GND (translators always active); FPGA tristates its drivers when idle."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.314 21.336 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002")
	)
	(text "J1 — pin 1 top-left of connector body.\nPins 1, 34, 35, 68 = chassis/signal GND.\nPins 17, 51 = +5V from Marty (parallel — route both pins).\nWAIT# (pin 59) is open-drain card output (wire as needed; treat as bidir in FPGA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003")
	)
	(text "U_LS4 — split-direction control shifter:\n  Group 1 (1A/1B): Marty -> FPGA, DIR=+3V3   1A1=MA_IORD_N, 1A2=MA_IOWR_N (rest NC, unused in memory mode).\n  Group 2 (2A/2B): FPGA -> Marty, DIR=GND    2A1..2A6 = INPACK_N, IREQ_N, WAIT_N, IOIS16_N/WP, BVD1, BVD2.\nNote: PCMCIA spec calls for open-drain on IREQ/WAIT; we drive push-pull (single-card setup, no shared lines).\nIf a future revision shares the bus, replace U_LS4 group 2 outputs with discrete N-FET open-drain drivers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 404.622 28.194 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004")
	)
